cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Seasonal in your research, teaching, or publications, please cite it as follows."
title: "Seasonal: High-Precision Solar Tracking Engine"

authors:
  - family-names: "Youssoufi"
    given-names: "Marwane"

version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2025-12-05"
license: "GPL-3.0"

repository-code: "https://github.com/Nouni2/Seasonal"

identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.17832852"
    description: "Concept DOI representing all versions of Seasonal."

abstract: >
  Seasonal is a high-precision solar position engine providing apparent
  altitude and azimuth using a full physical model (VSOP87D, nutation,
  aberration, refraction, and topocentric corrections). It includes a
  FastAPI backend and interactive web interface for 2D and 3D geospatial
  visualization.

keywords:
  - solar position
  - ephemeris
  - astronomy
  - solar geometry
  - scientific computing
  - VSOP87D
  - daylight analysis
